{%- comment -%}
  Section: ds-lp-city  (Step 7 — SHARED city / geo coverage landing)
  Purpose: Reusable, settings+blocks-driven geo landing page. Mississauga is the
           first instance; later cities reuse this SAME section and supply their
           own content via a page.city-<slug>.json template — no per-city forks.
  Used by: page.city-mississauga.json (handle: office-furniture-mississauga) and
           later city templates.
  Sections: nav → breadcrumbs → hero → intro (answer-first lede) + E-E-A-T byline →
            how-we-serve (feature blocks) → recent local projects (local_proof
            blocks — REAL projects only; section omitted when none) → browse the
            catalog (category_link blocks) → entity / OECM note →
            FAQ (faq_item blocks) → CTA closer → footer → JSON-LD.
  Blocks:   `feature`     — a "how we serve <city>" coverage card (delivery window,
                            install crew, lead times, project coordination …).
            `local_proof` — one REAL local project per block. HONESTY GATE: only add
                            a block when a genuine, verifiable project in that city
                            exists. No invented case studies, no stock posing as a
                            local job. When a city has none, add zero blocks and the
                            section does not render — the page stands as honest
                            delivery + install COVERAGE.
            `category_link` — one catalog cross-link tile (label + URL + meta).
            `faq_item`    — one Q/A. Visible accordion AND bbi-faq-jsonld are built
                            from the SAME blocks (question + "||" + answer, joined on
                            "~~~"), so the schema text byte-matches the on-page Q/A
                            (SCHEMA-CRIT-1). Block copy must never contain "||"/"~~~".
  JSON-LD:  Organization/LocalBusiness is emitted sitewide by bbi-nav → bbi-org-schema
            and is NOT re-emitted here. After the footer this page emits, exactly once
            each:
              • bbi-service-jsonld   — one Service node; areaServed is the city, the
                                       provider is an @id ref to …/#organization. NO
                                       city-specific LocalBusiness / address / phone:
                                       one real business, one HQ. City specificity is
                                       areaServed ONLY (NAP integrity).
              • bbi-breadcrumb-jsonld — Home → <city> (absolute URLs assigned first).
              • bbi-faq-jsonld       — only if faq_item blocks exist.
  NAP:      Single HQ, unchanged everywhere: Brant Business Interiors, 701 The Queensway, Units 2-4,
            Peterborough, ON K9J 7J6 · 1-800-835-9565 · since 1964.
  Notes:    since-1964 / Canadian copy carries the maple-leaf accent (.bbi-icon--leaf).
            Reuses the .lp-* / .lp-ds vocabulary from ds-lp-* and ds-review-base — no
            new design tokens, no new schema snippets.
{%- endcomment -%}

