    { "type": "header", "content": "Intro (answer-first lede) + E-E-A-T" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "intro_eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "The short answer" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "intro_heading", "label": "Heading (answer-first lede)", "default": "Yes — Brant Business Interiors delivers and installs office furniture in Mississauga, with our own crew and one Ontario account team from quote to install." },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "eeat_note", "label": "E-E-A-T byline", "default": "Supplied by Brant Business Interiors — authorized contract-furniture dealer and OECM Supplier Partner, supplying and installing commercial office furniture across Ontario since 1964." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "intro_h3_1", "label": "Column 1 heading", "default": "How we cover Mississauga" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "intro_para1", "label": "Column 1 paragraph", "default": "Brant Business Interiors is a family-owned Ontario commercial furniture dealer, headquartered at 701 The Queensway, Units 2-4 in Peterborough and serving Mississauga and the wider Greater Toronto Area. We are not a Mississauga storefront — we are the team that quotes your order, schedules a coordinated delivery window, and arrives with our own installation crew to place, assemble, and level every piece on site. One Ontario account team handles the quote, the delivery, the install, and any warranty service after." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "intro_h3_2", "label": "Column 2 heading", "default": "Who we supply in Mississauga" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "intro_para2", "label": "Column 2 paragraph", "default": "Mississauga offices, private clinics, professional firms, schools, and municipal departments order from our full contract catalogue — seating, desks and workstations, boardroom and reception, storage, and acoustic. As an OECM Supplier Partner, eligible Ontario broader-public-sector buyers in Mississauga can purchase furniture and installation from us without an open tender. Single chair or a multi-floor fit-out, the same crew delivers and installs it." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "How we serve (feature blocks)" },
